{
  "name": "The Right Tool for the Job",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You learn how to produce exactly the tool you need: with thieves' tools or artisan's tools in hand, you can magically create one set of artisan's tools in an unoccupied space within 5 feet of you. This creation requires 1 hour of uninterrupted work, which can coincide with a Short or a Long Rest. Though the product of magic, the tools are nonmagical, and they vanish when you use this feature again.</p>",
